    "  \n",
    "### The Progression\n",
    "  \n",
    "| Model                            | Components Captured                  |\n",
    "| :------------------------------- | :----------------------------------- |\n",
    "| **Simple Exponential Smoothing** | 📍 Level                             |\n",
    "| **Holt**                         | 📍 Level + 📈 Trend                  |\n",
    "| **Holt-Winters**                 | 📍 Level + 📈 Trend + 🔄 Seasonality |\n",
    "\n",
    "> **The key idea:** Each model adds another component of the underlying time-series pattern."
